'''{{PAGENAME}}''', located southwest of [[Stardew:Pelican Town|Pelican Town]], is accessible from a path branching off the southern exit of Pelican Town, from a path leading west off The Beach, or via a path located east of [[Fairhaven Farm]] in [[Cindersap Forest]]. It is where [[Sophia]] lives and works.

Sophia also sells various items via the ledger located in her crafts room in the southwest corner of the house.

